# AMPL `.sol` files are produced alongside their `.nl` inputs when the
# integration tests run the solver against a fixture. They're not
# fixtures themselves; the tests parse them in-process and discard.
*.sol

# One exception. The `feasible` verdict certifies the *float* the solver
# returned — that point is the subject of the claim, not an intermediate on the
# way to an exact one. Regenerating it would make the golden certificate track
# solver iterates rather than emitter behaviour, so this `.sol` is a fixture in
# its own right and is committed.
!certify_feasible.sol
